<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-11-10T18:01:23.604Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:01:23 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant groups and bandits continue to attack civilians in Nigeria, killing a pastor, a pregnant woman, schoolchildren and a family of twelve, while troops repelled a terrorist assault and rescued three kidnapping victims. Mali’s forces recaptured Kidal and Russian electronic-warfare vehicles operated there, and Russia helped foil a coup in Niger, prompting EU concern over Algerian and Russian troop deployments in Niger. Burkina Faso, after aligning with Russia, has partnered with another Western state on its 36th reunification anniversary. The conflict still generates high fatalities, with 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOb2xYNnBaTFZmOEc1UFZvR0tnV2RHUnJ2WGNCZ3VqU2VBMzNOaEktZjhUcF9XNlNaNDIydk9ZbU5zQnJhSGdhQ05ib1dHME50Qm9HeGhTWHJHYXpacm45QlZMaE5XVmF1LUJld3NIWnJwOEhKclNrOENTQTN0TDBXLWFrSzQ0RXM1cVhiWnprQ1hzNHVCLWhxN05OaG5vRW14ODhYVTZ4MDlVOWM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Business Insider Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTE5LRWl5bnFhX0JucWNQQnY4MVlXMDBPY0hqdHNBdnQ4MzJ5aUt3bDhkQXlHWHh6UDBIdUlScUplc3Y4X1ZPbGFJLTZCZmtEWC1zNDJNb3lSSnhYUXJucDNRbnptTQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxNM1cwS3BabXh2bjlVajZVSC1KSnRxSG5kaFJMaXFBSlM0Rl9hMDEybldBUXZPTU5BNzhUNWwxZTRYa0djTGtfRDNYbGVtbzNmMzQ2UXVXdll4c2liX2dfang0YUdkaENQZUZNOXJ3Y2ZiZVhyR0xRUzNkTll3NU9WWTRRMXdOVGczaFhwWW1lVDA0N3ZuSnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Modern Ghana&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxPYnZ4Z204dXZpdmFnQ2hHTk1VZE1ZMGxHV1U2anJOSkVxNFpXVmtGbDB2TU1wWTl2SnNwRkhRRS13OXVWQVBzVHFQYTJkY2t5Rk1HWnNXbnNia01tQ1RPZkJGcFhURjNReC1PZFEzMXo5Z0JJcWlBNWd5R25iQkVBbXNFT